'install_59'	=>	"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <title>账号激活</title>\r\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n        html,\r\n        body {\r\n          font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n          line-height: 1.5;\r\n          font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p {\r\n          margin-top: 0;\r\n          margin-bottom: 11px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p:last-child {\r\n          margin-bottom: 0;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:active,\r\n        a:visited,\r\n        a:link {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: none;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:hover {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: underline;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f0f0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; max-width:1024px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 16px 16px -10px rgba(34,47,62,.15),0 0 40px 1px rgba(34,47,62,.15); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#4C6891; color:#ffffff; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:12px; padding-bottom:12px; vertical-align:middle; border-top-left-radius:6px; border-top-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:15px;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(51, 51, 51, .5);\">\r\n                            账号激活\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; text-align:left; padding:20px; border-bottom-left-radius:6px; border-bottom-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                            {%username%},<br><br>这是一封从网站 {$url} 发出的邮件<br><br>您收到此邮件是因为此 e-mail 地址被用于在网站上注册。如果您没有在该网站上注册，请忽略并删除此邮件。您将不会再次收到此类邮件。<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>您在网站上的登录名和密码：<br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>登录名：{%username%}<br>密码：{%password%}<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>激活说明<br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>感谢您的注册。我们需要您确认您的注册，以验证您输入的 e-mail 地址是真实的。这是为了防止不良滥用和垃圾邮件。<br><br>要激活您的账号，请点击以下链接：<br><br><a href=\"{%validationlink%}\" target=\"_blank\">{%validationlink%}</a><br><br>如果这些操作后仍然无法激活，可能是您的账号已被删除。在这种情况下，请联系管理员解决问题。<br><br>此致，<br>{$url} 管理团队\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </table>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>",
'install_60'	=>	"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <title>{%subject%}</title>\r\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n        html,\r\n        body {\r\n          font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n          line-height: 1.5;\r\n          font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p {\r\n          margin-top: 0;\r\n          margin-bottom: 11px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p:last-child {\r\n          margin-bottom: 0;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:active,\r\n        a:visited,\r\n        a:link {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: none;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:hover {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: underline;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f0f0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; max-width:1024px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 16px 16px -10px rgba(34,47,62,.15),0 0 40px 1px rgba(34,47,62,.15); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#4C6891; color:#ffffff; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:12px; padding-bottom:12px; vertical-align:middle; border-top-left-radius:6px; border-top-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:15px;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(51, 51, 51, .5);\">\r\n                            {%subject%}\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; text-align:left; padding:20px; border-bottom-left-radius:6px; border-bottom-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                            {%username_to%},<br><br>这是 {%username_from%} 通过网站 {$url} 发送给您的邮件<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>消息正文<br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>{%text%}<br><br>发送者 IP 地址：{%ip%}<br>用户组：{%group%}<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>请记住，网站管理团队不对本邮件的内容负责<br><br>此致，<br>{$url} 管理团队\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </table>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>",
'install_61'	=>	"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <title>找回忘记的密码</title>\r\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n        html,\r\n        body {\r\n          font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n          line-height: 1.5;\r\n          font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p {\r\n          margin-top: 0;\r\n          margin-bottom: 11px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p:last-child {\r\n          margin-bottom: 0;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:active,\r\n        a:visited,\r\n        a:link {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: none;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:hover {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: underline;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f0f0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; max-width:1024px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 16px 16px -10px rgba(34,47,62,.15),0 0 40px 1px rgba(34,47,62,.15); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#4C6891; color:#ffffff; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:12px; padding-bottom:12px; vertical-align:middle; border-top-left-radius:6px; border-top-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:15px;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(51, 51, 51, .5);\">\r\n                            找回忘记的密码\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; text-align:left; padding:20px; border-bottom-left-radius:6px; border-bottom-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                            尊敬的 {%username%},<br><br>您在网站 {$url} 上发出了获取忘记密码的请求。但出于安全原因，所有密码均以加密形式存储，因此我们无法告知您的旧密码。如果您想生成新密码，请点击以下链接：<br><br>{%lostlink%}<br><br>如果您没有发出过获取密码的请求，请直接删除此邮件。您的密码存储在安全的地方，他人无法获取。<br><br>发送者 IP 地址：{%ip%}<br><br>此致，<br>{$url} 管理团队<br>\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </table>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>",
'install_62'	=>	"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <title>网站文章发布通知</title>\r\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n        html,\r\n        body {\r\n          font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n          line-height: 1.5;\r\n          font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p {\r\n          margin-top: 0;\r\n          margin-bottom: 11px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p:last-child {\r\n          margin-bottom: 0;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:active,\r\n        a:visited,\r\n        a:link {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: none;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:hover {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: underline;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f0f0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; max-width:1024px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 16px 16px -10px rgba(34,47,62,.15),0 0 40px 1px rgba(34,47,62,.15); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#4C6891; color:#ffffff; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:12px; padding-bottom:12px; vertical-align:middle; border-top-left-radius:6px; border-top-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:15px;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(51, 51, 51, .5);\">\r\n                            网站文章发布通知\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; text-align:left; padding:20px; border-bottom-left-radius:6px; border-bottom-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                            尊敬的管理员，<br><br>通知您，网站 {$url} 已添加一篇新文章，目前正等待审核。<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>文章简要信息<br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>作者：{%username%}<br>文章标题：{%title%}<br>分类：{%category%}<br>添加日期：{%date%}<br><br>此致，<br>{$url} 管理团队\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </table>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>",
'install_63'	=>	"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <title>网站评论添加通知</title>\r\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n        html,\r\n        body {\r\n          font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n          line-height: 1.5;\r\n          font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p {\r\n          margin-top: 0;\r\n          margin-bottom: 11px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p:last-child {\r\n          margin-bottom: 0;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:active,\r\n        a:visited,\r\n        a:link {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: none;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:hover {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: underline;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f0f0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; max-width:1024px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 16px 16px -10px rgba(34,47,62,.15),0 0 40px 1px rgba(34,47,62,.15); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#4C6891; color:#ffffff; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:12px; padding-bottom:12px; vertical-align:middle; border-top-left-radius:6px; border-top-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:15px;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(51, 51, 51, .5);\">\r\n                            网站评论添加通知\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; text-align:left; padding:20px; border-bottom-left-radius:6px; border-bottom-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                            尊敬的 {%username_to%},<br><br>通知您，网站 {$url} 上有您订阅的文章添加了新评论。<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>评论简要信息<br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>作者：{%username%}<br>添加日期：{%date%}<br>文章链接：{%link%}<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>评论内容<br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>{%text%}<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>如果您不想再收到关于此文章新评论的通知，请点击此链接：<a href=\"{%unsubscribe%}\" target=\"_blank\">{%unsubscribe%}</a><br><br>此致，<br>{$url} 管理团队\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </table>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>",
'install_64'	=>	"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <title>收到网站站内信通知</title>\r\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n        html,\r\n        body {\r\n          font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n          line-height: 1.5;\r\n          font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p {\r\n          margin-top: 0;\r\n          margin-bottom: 11px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p:last-child {\r\n          margin-bottom: 0;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:active,\r\n        a:visited,\r\n        a:link {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: none;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:hover {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: underline;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f0f0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; max-width:1024px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 16px 16px -10px rgba(34,47,62,.15),0 0 40px 1px rgba(34,47,62,.15); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#4C6891; color:#ffffff; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:12px; padding-bottom:12px; vertical-align:middle; border-top-left-radius:6px; border-top-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:15px;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(51, 51, 51, .5);\">\r\n                            收到网站站内信通知\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; text-align:left; padding:20px; border-bottom-left-radius:6px; border-bottom-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                            尊敬的 {%username%},<br><br>通知您，网站 {$url} 向您发送了一封站内信。<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>邮件简要信息<br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>发送者：{%fromusername%}<br>接收日期：{%date%}<br>标题：{%title%}<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>消息正文<br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>{%text%}<br><br>此致，<br>{$url} 管理团队\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </table>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>",
'install_65'	=>	"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <title>社交网络绑定账号通知</title>\r\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n        html,\r\n        body {\r\n          font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n          line-height: 1.5;\r\n          font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p {\r\n          margin-top: 0;\r\n          margin-bottom: 11px;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        p:last-child {\r\n          margin-bottom: 0;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:active,\r\n        a:visited,\r\n        a:link {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: none;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:hover {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: underline;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f0f0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; max-width:1024px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 16px 16px -10px rgba(34,47,62,.15),0 0 40px 1px rgba(34,47,62,.15); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#4C6891; color:#ffffff; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:12px; padding-bottom:12px; vertical-align:middle; border-top-left-radius:6px; border-top-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:15px;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(51, 51, 51, .5);\">\r\n                            社交网络绑定账号通知\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; text-align:left; padding:20px; border-bottom-left-radius:6px; border-bottom-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                            尊敬的 {%username%},<br><br>您发出了将网站 {$url} 账号与社交网络 {%network%}. 账号进行关联的请求。但出于安全原因，您需要点击以下链接确认此操作：<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br><a href=\"{%link%}\" target=\"_blank\">{%link%}</a><br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>如果您没有发出此请求，请直接删除此邮件。您的账号信息存储在安全的地方，他人无法获取。<br><br>发送者 IP 地址：{%ip%}<br><br>此致，<br>{$url} 管理团队\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </table>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>",
'install_66'	=>	"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <title>{%title%}</title>\r\n    <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n        html,body{\r\n          font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n          line-height: 1.5;\r\n          font-size: 14px;\r\n        }\r\n        p {\r\n          margin-top: 0;\r\n          margin-bottom: 11px;\r\n        }\r\n        p:last-child {\r\n          margin-bottom: 0;\r\n        }     \r\n        a:active,\r\n        a:visited,\r\n        a:link {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration:none;\r\n        }\r\n        \r\n        a:hover {\r\n          color: #4C6891;\r\n          text-decoration: underline;\r\n        }\r\n    </style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f0f0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; max-width:1024px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 16px 16px -10px rgba(34,47,62,.15),0 0 40px 1px rgba(34,47,62,.15); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#4C6891; color:#ffffff; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:12px; padding-bottom:12px; vertical-align:middle; border-top-left-radius:6px; border-top-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:15px;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(51, 51, 51, .5);\">\r\n                            {%title%}\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                    <tr>\r\n                        <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; text-align:left; padding:20px; border-bottom-left-radius:6px; border-bottom-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n                            {%content%}\r\n                        </td>\r\n                    </tr>\r\n                </table>\r\n            </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </table>\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>",
'install_67'	=>	"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n  <title>双重身份验证</title>\r\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\r\n    html,\r\n    body {\r\n      font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\r\n      line-height: 1.5;\r\n      font-size: 14px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    p {\r\n      margin-top: 0;\r\n      margin-bottom: 11px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    p:last-child {\r\n      margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    a:active,\r\n    a:visited,\r\n    a:link {\r\n      color: #4C6891;\r\n      text-decoration: none;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    a:hover {\r\n      color: #4C6891;\r\n      text-decoration: underline;\r\n    }\r\n  </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f0f0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n  <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n    <tr>\r\n      <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:20px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n        <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0; max-width:1024px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 16px 16px -10px rgba(34,47,62,.15),0 0 40px 1px rgba(34,47,62,.15); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td style=\"background-color:#4C6891; color:#ffffff; padding-left:20px; padding-right:20px; padding-top:12px; padding-bottom:12px; vertical-align:middle; border-top-left-radius:6px; border-top-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:15px;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(51, 51, 51, .5);\">\r\n              双重身份验证\r\n            </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n          <tr>\r\n            <td style=\"background-color:#ffffff; color:#000000; text-align:left; padding:20px; border-bottom-left-radius:6px; border-bottom-right-radius:6px; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; font-size:14px;\">\r\n{%username%},<br><br>这是一封从网站 {$url} 发出的邮件<br><br>您收到此邮件是因为您的账号已启用双重身份验证。要在网站上登录，您需要输入收到的 PIN 码。<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>PIN 码：<br>------------------------------------------------<br><br>{%pin%}<br><br>------------------------------------------------<br>如果您未在我们的网站上登录，说明您的密码已被他人获知。您需要立即使用您的登录名和密码进入网站，并在个人资料中更改密码。<br><br>输入密码的用户 IP 地址：{%ip%}<br><br>此致，<br>{$url} 管理团队\r\n           </td>\r\n          </tr>\r\n        </table>\r\n      </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  </table>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>",

